{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-14_22-44-04-hashicorp_raft-real-run/draft && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('update.json'))\njh_repair=(\\\"Two receipts of two fixed experiments from the same scenario lineage: fa1f90c2eefd45e6af45d7593ac53205 records the healed divergent state before any repair, and \\\"\n \\\"112186e8b9544b51b4f7818a04c78a84 is the further revision of the same harness that adds the repair phase and records the post-install state. They are compatible because both observe the same \\\"\n \\\"cluster identity, configuration contents and conflict index (fixture event index 0 in each, conflict index 11, term 3), and the repair receipt's fixture and healed events carry the same values as the \\\"\n \\\"earlier receipt's healed event; each outcome is read from its own receipt and no value is combined across them.\\\")\njh_child=(\\\"Four receipts of three fixed experiments and one further revision over the same defect chain: b68f3d3a08b34cd6a27b76faeb0d2a3e observes the split, 455e647ad0794a16903414b5a8846276 adds the \\\"\n \\\"healing phase, fa1f90c2eefd45e6af45d7593ac53205 adds applied-state sampling, and 112186e8b9544b51b4f7818a04c78a84 - filed under the repair question - adds the repair phase to the same harness. \\\"\n \\\"Compatibility rests on the shared fixture in every receipt (fixture event index 0: snapshot index 6 with configuration {A,B,C}, a committed configuration entry with {A,B,C,D,E} above it, stored commit \\\"\n \\\"index 8) and on the restarted node reporting {A,B,C} in each; the conflict index, term and write payloads are identical across the receipts (index 11, term 3, minority-write against majority-write). \\\"\n \\\"Each comparison outcome is read from its own receipt, and the later receipts restricted their comparison sets to their new predicates, so they are not additive evidence for predicates already recorded.\\\")\nfor i in d['interpretations']:\n    if i.get('experiment_id')=='761ecfb0e8b14df99a7f85eacbd9b87a-experiment':\n        i['joint_history']=jh_repair\n    if i['investigation_id']=='3eae8e12b0574799b781f10f7899dbad-question-0' and 'experiment_id' not in i:\n        i['joint_history']=jh_child\njson.dump(d,open('update.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ncd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-14_22-44-04-hashicorp_raft-real-run && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-14_22-44-04-hashicorp_raft-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | tail -3\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
